{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_rammus": {
        "attack": "【扩展包】翻身撞击。<#ff9028ff>锥刺甲壳<>：获得<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0>护甲与魔抗之和<#a974ffff>35%<>的攻击力。<#ff9028ff>尖刺防御<>：敌方英雄靠近时蜷起来，<#ffb900ff>7秒<>内护甲+42（+40%）、魔抗+28（+40%），普攻他的敌人受到<#a974ffff>20<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0><#a974ffff>10%<>护甲+<#a974ffff>10%<>魔抗魔法伤害；放动力冲刺、冲天猛撞时收起。",
        "skill": "【扩展包】缩成球滚动，越滚越快（移速每秒+25%~41%，随等级，最多<#ffb900ff>6秒<>），撞上第一个敌人时对周围造成<#a974ffff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>110%<>魔法伤害，<#ef5350ff>击退<>、<#ef5350ff>眩晕<><#ffb900ff>0.4秒<>并<#ef5350ff>减速40%<><#ffb900ff>1秒<>。",
        "skill2": "【扩展包】<#ef5350ff>嘲讽<>一名敌方英雄<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>。滚动时不能施放。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_rammus": {
        "attack": "【擴充包】翻身撞擊。<#ff9028ff>錐刺甲殼<>：獲得<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0>護甲與魔抗之和<#a974ffff>35%<>的攻擊力。<#ff9028ff>尖刺防禦<>：敵方英雄靠近時蜷起來，<#ffb900ff>7秒<>內護甲+42（+40%）、魔抗+28（+40%），普攻他的敵人受到<#a974ffff>20<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0><#a974ffff>10%<>護甲+<#a974ffff>10%<>魔抗魔法傷害；施放動力衝刺、飛天動地時收起。",
        "skill": "【擴充包】縮成球滾動，越滾越快（移速每秒+25%~41%，隨等級，最多<#ffb900ff>6秒<>），撞上第一個敵人時對周圍造成<#a974ffff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>110%<>魔法傷害，<#ef5350ff>擊退<>、<#ef5350ff>暈眩<><#ffb900ff>0.4秒<>並<#ef5350ff>緩速40%<><#ffb900ff>1秒<>。",
        "skill2": "【擴充包】<#ef5350ff>嘲諷<>一名敵方英雄<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<>。滾動時不能施放。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_rammus": {
        "attack": "[Add-on] A tumbling slam. <#ff9028ff>Spiked Shell<>: bonus attack damage of <#a974ffff>35%<> of his <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0>armour + magic resist. <#ff9028ff>Defensive Ball Curl<>: near an enemy champion he curls up for <#ffb900ff>7s<>: +42 (+40%) armour, +28 (+40%) magic resist, and his basic attackers take <#a974ffff>20<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0><#a974ffff>10%<> armour + <#a974ffff>10%<> magic resist <#a974ffff>magic damage<>; Powerball or Soaring Slam ends it.",
        "skill": "[Add-on] Curls into a ball and rolls, faster and faster (+25% to +41% move speed a second by level, up to <#ffb900ff>6s<>); the first enemy he meets: nearby enemies take <#a974ffff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>110%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<>, are <#ef5350ff>knocked back<>, <#ef5350ff>stunned<> <#ffb900ff>0.4s<> and <#ef5350ff>slowed 40%<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<>.",
        "skill2": "[Add-on] <#ef5350ff>Taunts<> an enemy champion for <#ffb900ff>1.5s<>. Not while rolling."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_rammus": {
        "attack": "[확장] 몸통 박치기. <#ff9028ff>가시박힌 껍질<>: <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0>방어력·마법 저항력 합의 <#a974ffff>35%<>만큼 공격력 증가. <#ff9028ff>몸 말아 웅크리기<>: 적 챔피언이 가까우면 웅크려 <#ffb900ff>7초<> 동안 방어력 +42(+40%), 마법 저항력 +28(+40%), 기본 공격한 적에게 <#a974ffff>20<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0>방어력 <#a974ffff>10%<>+마법 저항력 <#a974ffff>10%<> 마법 피해. 대회전·지진 폭격 시 풀림.",
        "skill": "[확장] 몸을 말아 점점 빠르게 굴러가고(이동 속도 매초 +25%~41%, 레벨 비례, 최대 <#ffb900ff>6초<>) 처음 만난 적에게 부딪히면 주변 적에게 <#a974ffff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>110%<> 마법 피해, <#ef5350ff>밀쳐내기<>, <#ffb900ff>0.4초<> <#ef5350ff>기절<>, <#ffb900ff>1초<> <#ef5350ff>40% 둔화<>.",
        "skill2": "[확장] 적 챔피언 하나를 <#ffb900ff>1.5초<> <#ef5350ff>도발<>. 구르는 동안에는 쓸 수 없음."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_rammus": {
        "attack": "【拡張】体当たり。<#ff9028ff>トゲトゲ<>：<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0>物防と魔防の合計の<#a974ffff>35%<>だけ攻撃力アップ。<#ff9028ff>かたくなる<>：敵チャンピオンが近いと丸まり、<#ffb900ff>7秒<>物防+42(+40%)・魔防+28(+40%)、通常攻撃してきた敵に<#a974ffff>20<>+<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:armor_0>物防<#a974ffff>10%<>+魔防<#a974ffff>10%<>の魔法ダメージ。ころころ・どーんどーんで解除。",
        "skill": "【拡張】丸まって転がり、だんだん速くなる（移動速度毎秒+25%～41%、レベルで増加、最大<#ffb900ff>6秒<>）。最初の敵にぶつかると周りの敵に<#a974ffff>110<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>110%<>の魔法ダメージ、<#ef5350ff>ノックバック<>、<#ffb900ff>0.4秒<><#ef5350ff>スタン<>と<#ffb900ff>1秒<>の<#ef5350ff>40%スロウ<>。",
        "skill2": "【拡張】敵チャンピオン1体を<#ffb900ff>1.5秒<><#ef5350ff>挑発<>。転がっている間は使えない。"
      }
    }
  }
}
